## Discussion

### 1. Project Requirements
The team discussed the requirements for the Skills Track Learner Support Portal, including the need for a dashboard, task manager, support bookings, progress report, learning resources, and a coding mini-game. The team also discussed the use of FireBase for authentication and data storage, and GitHub for version control. The team agreed to use HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for the application development.

### 2. Application Features
The team discussed the dashboard, task manager, support bookings, progress tracking, learning resources, and coding mini-game.

### 3. Firebase
The team discussed using Firebase Authentication for user accounts and Firebase Realtime Database for storing application data.

### 4. GitHub
The team agreed to use GitHub for version control and collaboration. Changes will be made through branches and committed regularly.

## Decisions Made

- The application will use HTML, CSS and JavaScript.
- Firebase will be used for authentication and database storage.
- GitHub will be used for version control.
- The application will include a task manager and support-booking system.
- A coding mini-game will be included.

